:INFO
Art. 1 Subject matter
This Ordinance shall regulate electronic access to non-publicly accessible data by other Swiss oversight authorities, pursuant to Article 22 of the Auditor Oversight Act of 16 December 2005 (AOA).
|

:NOTE
Art. 1 — Amended by Annex No 2 of the Health Insurance Oversight Ordinance of 18 Nov. 2015, in force since 1 Jan. 2016 (AS 2015 5165).
SR 221.302
|

:INFO
Art. 2 Non-publicly accessible data
1 Non-publicly accessible data is data that is not included in the register of auditors (Art. 19 ff. AOO) and that arises from licence applications, the documents submitted with these applications or the decisions on the granting of licences, or that is collected in another way in application of the AOA.
2 The non-publicly accessible data and the level of access permitted to this data are set out in the Annex.
|

